Bind Npc 19005 Zone 21
Quest 1120 "Certificating qualifications : proof of wealth"
    Journal "Donate 1 Gold Bar"
    Collect 100000000 coins

Requires player level >= 83 and quest 1119 is completed

Rewards none

On offer
    Say "Congratulation on your proving of your power. The second test is about your wealth. Without wealth, you won't be able to be a hero."
    Topic "The ...Where do you like that?" do
        Say "If you don't wanna believe it it's fine."
        Topic "Ah ...You got it." do
            Show quest "Bring 100,000,000 Noah?"

On in_progress
    Say "you still don't have 100,000,000 Noah?"

On claimable
    Show quest "This!! Shiny thing!!  It's a gold bar! If you want to complete, come back to me again. I'll take the gold bar now."
